### Telecom CDR API – IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client
@api = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### Buffered batch (≤ 5,000 records, ≤ 10MB)
POST {{api}}/cdrs/batch
Content-Type: application/json

< ./sample-data/batch.json

### Streaming NDJSON
POST {{api}}/cdrs/stream?source=MSC-01&batchId=SAMPLE-FEED
Content-Type: application/x-ndjson

< ./sample-data/cdrs-small.ndjson

### Streaming with invalid and duplicate records (partial acceptance)
POST {{api}}/cdrs/stream?source=MSC-02
Content-Type: application/x-ndjson

< ./sample-data/cdrs-with-errors.ndjson

### Async ingestion (202 + Location)
POST {{api}}/cdrs/async?source=MSC-03
Content-Type: application/x-ndjson

< ./sample-data/cdrs-small.ndjson

### Recent ingestion jobs
GET {{api}}/ingestion-jobs

### One job (paste the id from the 202 response)
GET {{api}}/ingestion-jobs/REPLACE-WITH-JOB-ID

### Usage summary (adjust msisdn / dates to your data)
GET {{api}}/subscribers/9000001033/usage?from=2026-09-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-10-31T00:00:00Z

### Paged CDR listing (size is capped at 500)
GET {{api}}/cdrs?msisdn=9000001033&from=2026-09-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-10-31T00:00:00Z&page=0&size=50

### Unsupported Content-Encoding -> 415
POST {{api}}/cdrs/stream?source=X
Content-Type: application/x-ndjson
Content-Encoding: br

{}
